#X text 82 828 bang \, <1-127>: trigger \, the number is the velocity \; <control> <0-127>: set a control by name \, e.g. gap 64 \; ctl <index> <0-127> \, params v0 v1 ...: set by index \; defaults \, reset: default controls \, restart the voice \; level <0-8>: output gain \, default 1 \; get <control>: reply 'value <control> <v>' on outlet 1 \; print: voice \, controls and sample rate to the Pd window \; choke \, chokems <ms>: fade the voice out \, default 3 ms \; store <0-15> \, recall <0-15>: 16 internal slots \; recall \, defaults: report 'params v0 v1 ...' on outlet 1 \; dump \, dump <0-15>: send all controls to outlet 1 \; dump trxoh v0 v1 ...: restore a dump of this voice, f 64;
